=== Heian Period ===
According to the {{ill|Shoku Nihon Kōki|ja|続日本後紀|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shoku Nihon Kōki|qq=}}, in 839 (Jōwa 6), the shrine received the Rank of Junior Fifth Rank, Lower Grade. The {{ill|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|ja|日本三代実録|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|qq=}} records that the shrine was promoted multiple times between 867 (Jōgan 9) and 880 (Gangyō 4), eventually reaching Junior Fourth Rank, Upper Grade. It is said that by around 1028 (Chōgen 9), it was promoted to Senior First Rank.

